{"id": "DdAXNtQiT_w", "title": "Video by valeridoesai", "description": "Comment “CLONE” and I’ll send you the link.\n\nStop rebuilding websites from scratch when you can turn a screenshot into a working site.\n\nThere’s an open-source repo called Screenshot to Code that can take a screenshot and generate the code for you.\n\nHere’s what it does:\n\nUpload a screenshot\nAnalyzes layout, spacing, typography, and colors\nGenerates the website code\nGives you a live preview\nLets you iterate in the same window\nSupports different vision models\nCan generate placeholder images so the result feels more complete\nCan be self-hosted with your own API keys\n\nBasically, you give it the design and it gives you a working starting point.\n\nComment “CLONE” and I’ll send you the link.\n\nMake sure you're following so the DM lands.\n\n#ScreenshotToCode #WebDevelopment #AIWebDesign", "channel": "valeridoesai", "uploader_id": "36966948252", "uploader": "Valeri Sabev | Building with AI", "timestamp": 1788826106, "like_count": 190, "comment_count": 160, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18104546624236253a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 71.096, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.flis9-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNNlH24cTM-Xy1mdbpFJiVTQcdegQawb91otKmXdMPnia8GtgtozMjx7hHNZDZj8f-uvarvxrhpTcHir279sdBpnz-gQEg3zolz-ek.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdrR4yiAXgCQOVWIbFIBHUx8qmMyt3ALFH3ImFimSRiNDpnoR87obfIuheuq14XfEN0&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.flis9-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=TMiZ_XHfV3QQ7kNvwG7WQ2u&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=IrKCLQGe2dUvMcTgsuNd7w&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIR0